WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.520
Jerusalem, before dawn.

2
00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:07.380
Huge pale stone blocks rise
above a wide open square.

3
00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:11.990
People press tiny folded notes
into the cracks between the stones.

4
00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.060
Many of the notes are written
prayers, left there by visitors.

5
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:20.060
Why do Jews tuck their prayers
into an old stone wall?

6
00:00:20.110 --> 00:00:23.580
In this mission, you'll read
an ancient promise of a land,

7
00:00:23.630 --> 00:00:27.450
made to Abram, and a
prophet's hope for Zion.

8
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.390
Then you'll compare how different
groups of Jews see the State of Israel,

9
00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.880
founded in 1948.

10
00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:39.380
Your mission: find out why Jews tuck
prayers into the cracks of an old stone wall

11
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:40.440
in Jerusalem.
